{
  "slug": "cartographer",
  "name": "Cartographer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent-first code understanding system. Builds a persistent world-model of your codebase with evidence-grounded facts, visual map projections, and inspectable source anchors.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 command**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `analyze` (Analyze a codebase and build a world-model — traces behaviors, records entities with evidence, creates boundaries by concern), `explore` (Deep autonomous codebase exploration — traces behaviors end-to-end, creates boundaries by concern, builds navigable depth with sub-boundaries, enforces…), `inspect` (Query the Cartographer world-model to answer questions about a codebase using stored evidence), `review-pr` (Visualize a pull request on the Cartographer map — see which entities are affected, the blast radius, and…), `verify` (Run the self-serve verification loop — boot the current source stack against a golden fixture, assert every layer…)\n- **Agents** (1): `explorer` (Deep autonomous codebase exploration with persistent memory)\n- **Commands** (1): `cartographer` (Cartographer — code understanding system)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cartographer`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cartographer@claude-community` from `miltonian/cartographer` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
